description: ISC DHCPD parsed DHCPv4 transaction -> OCSF DHCP Activity.
args:
  positional:
    - name: event
      description: The active mapping scope.
      type: field
    - name: ocsf
      description: The OCSF output field.
      type: field
---

dhcpd::ocsf::events::transaction $event, $ocsf
